\u2019m a tightrope walker of escape,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "Defying laws with passion\u2019s shape,"}, {"beat": 228, "text": "With me, boredom finds no space,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "Follow me boundlessly to our own place."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}